# Swift Horde raptor from Zjolnir (Sen'jin Village).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: the client files every racial riding spell under one Riding
# skill (SkillLineAbility), so any riding trainer of your faction teaches it:
# Apprentice Riding (skill 75) from level 40, Journeyman Riding (150) at 60.
# Blizzard: learning to ride grants a mount, and training costs 100g at 40 and
# 1,000g at 60 (Kris Zierhut). ItemSparse lists the
# mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60), usable by every race of the
# faction; whether a vendor still wants Exalted with another race's city (the
# Era rule) is server-side and unconfirmed.

step Journeyman Riding
  zone Durotar
  tip Xar'Ti and Zjolnir's raptors are in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast. At 60 Xar'Ti teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift raptor for 200g at level 60.
  level 60
  train 7953                          -- Xar'Ti, riding trainer
  skill Riding 150

step Pick a colour
  tip Zjolnir sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 7952                         -- Zjolnir
  buy 18788 npc 7952 optional         -- Swift Blue Raptor, 200g
  buy 18789 npc 7952 optional         -- Swift Olive Raptor, 200g
  buy 18790 npc 7952 optional         -- Swift Orange Raptor, 200g
  note Whistle of the Venomhide Ravasaur (level 60) is in the Forever client, but its source is not known yet.
